  _englishVersion: "Under Their Skin:Steal yourself a nice, warm jacket (their skin)
    by interacting with their corpse. Temporarily embrace the warmth and wear their
    fleshy \u2018meat suit\u2019, mimicking the ability to hold certain items. Hit
    {0} to remove it abruptly!"
